[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 241.215, "timestamp": "00:04:01", "text": "关于你的计划，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 245.701, "timestamp": "00:04:05", "text": "是的？所以，既然"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.986, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "我的声音很尴尬。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 248.069, "timestamp": "00:04:08", "text": "我想到一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 249.219, "timestamp": "00:04:09", "text": "比如，“好的，这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.267, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "真漂亮，嗯，这是我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.91, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "独特的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 252.263, "timestamp": "00:04:12", "text": "“关于你自己的特别之处” 。所以我拿走了它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 257.444, "timestamp": "00:04:17", "text": "。所以我拿走了它 心想：“好吧，那又怎样？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 258.822, "timestamp": "00:04:18", "text": "心想：“好吧，那又怎样？” 我的状态和外貌如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 260.166, "timestamp": "00:04:20", "text": "我的状态和外貌如何？ 我会把它弄得令人困惑，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 261.475, "timestamp": "00:04:21", "text": "我会把它弄得令人困惑，而且 因此我们有了一个新的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 262.75, "timestamp": "00:04:22", "text": "因此我们有了一个新的 运动员”。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 271.156, "timestamp": "00:04:31", "text": "简而言之，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.585, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "你看动漫，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 273.904, "timestamp": "00:04:33", "text": "你可以把它想象成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 276.702, "timestamp": "00:04:36", "text": "史莱姆动漫 《Remaru Tempest》"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 276.838, "timestamp": "00:04:36", "author": "@Kenn_D_Bush", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/_Komo_VEKSz-e7kb-dTpjPDPdwLBWdimZXGs-iY-B0gcs1aY-MXI_lQXH90AN623vf5ag2FRRA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Da new joq"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 277.795, "timestamp": "00:04:37", "text": "《Remaru Tempest》 就这样。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 285.439, "timestamp": "00:04:45", "text": "这是一个可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 286.593, "timestamp": "00:04:46", "text": "改变形状，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 288.08299999999997, "timestamp": "00:04:48", "text": "外表和能力……呃—— 呃，是的，它就像一个身体，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 289.424, "timestamp": "00:04:49", "text": "呃，是的，它就像一个身体，不是 有性别之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 290.765, "timestamp": "00:04:50", "text": "有性别之类的 像这样，或者，嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 291.733, "timestamp": "00:04:51", "text": "像这样，或者，嗯， 生殖器之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 292.999, "timestamp": "00:04:52", "text": "生殖器之类的东西 像这样。就这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 298.8, "timestamp": "00:04:58", "text": "像这样。就这样。 它叫什么？它"}]